{
  "name": "Evolution WhatsApp - Odoo Fichajes",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "name": "Evolution Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -600,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "evolution/whatsapp/fichajes",
        "responseMode": "responseNode"
      },
      "notes": "Escucha las notificaciones entrantes de Evolution WhatsApp. Configura la URL generada en Evolution como webhook de mensajes entrantes.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "name": "Preparar Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -380,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "const body = $json.body ?? $json;\n\nconst rawMessage = (body.message?.text ?? body.message?.body ?? body.text ?? body.body ?? body.message ?? '').toString().trim();\nconst normalizedMessage = rawMessage\n  .normalize('NFD')\n  .replace(/[\\u0300-\\u036f]/g, '')\n  .toLowerCase();\n\nconst phoneRaw = (body.from ?? body.sender ?? body.phone ?? body.contact?.phone ?? body.message?.from ?? '').toString();\nconst phone = phoneRaw.replace(/[^0-9+]/g, '').replace(/^\+?34/, '').replace(/^0+/, '');\n\nconst keywordsIn = [\n  'entro',\n  'ficho',\n  'ya estoy aqui',\n  'ya llegue',\n  'llegue',\n  'iniciar fichaje'\n];\nconst keywordsOut = [\n  'salgo',\n  'salida',\n  'me voy',\n  'termine',\n  'fichaje salida',\n  'salida fichaje',\n  'sali'\n];\n\nlet action = null;\nif (keywordsIn.some(keyword => normalizedMessage.includes(keyword))) {\n  action = 'check_in';\n} else if (keywordsOut.some(keyword => normalizedMessage.includes(keyword))) {\n  action = 'check_out';\n}\n\nconst employeeDirectory = {\n  '639925869': 42\n};\n\nconst employeeId = employeeDirectory[phone] ?? null;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    phone,\n    message: rawMessage,\n    normalizedMessage,\n    action,\n    employeeId,\n    receivedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n];"
      },
      "notes": "Normaliza el payload recibido, mapea el número de teléfono al empleado de Odoo (actualiza el diccionario employeeDirectory según tus empleados) y detecta si el mensaje corresponde a una entrada o salida de fichaje.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "name": "¿Número Autorizado?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.phone}}",
              "operation": "equal",
              "value2": "639925869"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Valida que el fichaje solo se procese para el número autorizado.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "name": "Set Respuesta No Autorizado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "keepOnlySet": true,
        "values": {
          "json": [
            {
              "name": "webhookResponse",
              "value": "={{({ status: 'ignored', reason: 'Número no autorizado', phone: $json.phone })}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Responde inmediatamente cuando el mensaje proviene de un número no autorizado.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "name": "¿Mensaje Reconocido?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.action}}",
              "operation": "notEmpty"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Comprueba si se encontró una palabra clave de entrada o salida.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "6",
      "name": "Set Respuesta Sin Acción",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        340,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "keepOnlySet": true,
        "values": {
          "json": [
            {
              "name": "webhookResponse",
              "value": "={{({ status: 'ignored', reason: 'Sin palabras clave de fichaje', phone: $json.phone, message: $json.message })}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Devuelve una respuesta informativa cuando el mensaje no contiene palabras clave reconocibles.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "7",
      "name": "Determinar Acción",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        340,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "value": "={{$json.action}}",
        "rules": [
          {
            "value": "check_in",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "value": "check_out",
            "type": "string"
          }
        ]
      },
      "notes": "Dirige el flujo hacia la creación de fichaje de entrada o de salida según la palabra clave detectada.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "8",
      "name": "Preparar Entrada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        580,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "json": [
            {
              "name": "attendancePayload",
              "value": "={{({ employee_id: $json.employeeId, check_in: $json.receivedAt })}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Genera el payload que se enviará a Odoo para registrar la entrada.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "9",
      "name": "Crear Fichaje Entrada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.odoo",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        820,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "record",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "hr.attendance",
        "dataFieldsUi": {
          "dataFieldsValues": [
            {
              "field": "employee_id",
              "value": "={{$json.attendancePayload.employee_id}}"
            },
            {
              "field": "check_in",
              "value": "={{$json.attendancePayload.check_in}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "odooApi": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR_ODDO_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Odoo - Producción"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Crea el registro de asistencia de entrada en Odoo.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "name": "Merge Entrada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine"
      },
      "notes": "Combina la respuesta de Odoo con los datos originales del mensaje.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "name": "Preparar Salida",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        580,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "json": [
            {
              "name": "attendancePayload",
              "value": "={{({ employee_id: $json.employeeId, check_out: $json.receivedAt })}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Genera el payload que se enviará a Odoo para registrar la salida.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "name": "Crear Fichaje Salida",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.odoo",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        820,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "record",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "hr.attendance",
        "dataFieldsUi": {
          "dataFieldsValues": [
            {
              "field": "employee_id",
              "value": "={{$json.attendancePayload.employee_id}}"
            },
            {
              "field": "check_out",
              "value": "={{$json.attendancePayload.check_out}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "odooApi": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR_ODDO_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Odoo - Producción"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Crea el registro de asistencia de salida en Odoo.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "name": "Merge Salida",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine"
      },
      "notes": "Combina la respuesta de Odoo con los datos originales del mensaje.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "name": "Preparar Confirmaciones",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1240,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "const items = [];\nfor (const item of items) {\n  const data = item.json;\n  let phone = data.phone || '';\n  if (!phone.startsWith('+')) {\n    phone = `+34${phone}`;\n  }\n  const message = data.action === 'check_in'\n    ? 'Tu fichaje de entrada se ha registrado correctamente en Odoo.'\n    : 'Tu fichaje de salida se ha registrado correctamente en Odoo.';\n\n  items.push({\n    json: {\n      ...data,\n      confirmationMessage: message,\n      replyPayload: {\n        to: phone,\n        message,\n        metadata: {\n          source: 'n8n',\n          action: data.action,\n          createdAt: new Date().toISOString()\n        }\n      },\n      webhookResponse: {\n        status: 'success',\n        action: data.action,\n        phone,\n        message,\n        odooAttendanceId: data.id ?? data.record_id ?? null,\n        receivedAt: data.receivedAt\n      }\n    }\n  });\n}\nreturn items;"
      },
      "notes": "Genera el mensaje de confirmación y prepara la respuesta tanto para WhatsApp como para Evolution.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "name": "Enviar Respuesta Evolution",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1460,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.evolution.com/v1/whatsapp/messages",
        "jsonParameters": true,
        "options": {
          "bodyContentType": "json",
          "headers": {
            "Content-Type": "application/json",
            "Authorization": "Bearer {{ $env.EVOLUTION_API_TOKEN }}"
          }
        },
        "bodyParametersJson": "={{$json.replyPayload}}"
      },
      "notes": "Envía la confirmación al usuario final mediante la API de Evolution. Sustituye la URL y la cabecera Authorization según tu entorno.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "name": "Merge Confirmación",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1680,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine"
      },
      "notes": "Propaga los datos originales tras enviar la respuesta a Evolution.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "name": "Responder Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1880,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "responseBody": "={{$json.webhookResponse}}",
        "responseCode": 200
      },
      "notes": "Cierra la petición HTTP inicial con un JSON informativo para Evolution.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    }
  ],
